---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Meet the Team"
description: "Meet the specialist recruitment consultants behind Abatec's engineering, industrial, civil and IT desks."
---
<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / About Us / Meet the Team</p>
    <span class="eyebrow">About Us</span>
    <h1>The people behind the placements.</h1>
    <p>Every Abatec consultant specialises in a single sector — so when you speak to us, you're speaking to someone who understands the role, not just the job title.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid--4">
      {% for member in team %}
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="team-card__photo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>{{ member.name }}</h3>
        <span>{{ member.sector }}</span>
        <p>{{ member.role }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section--slate">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <div>
        <h2>Thinking about a career in recruitment?</h2>
        <p>We're always interested in speaking to experienced consultants and ambitious graduates alike.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/careers/">Careers at Abatec</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
